{"name": "Sons of God — Arise", "tagline": "Creation is waiting for you.", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "folder": "sons-of-god-arise", "icon": "", "iconAlt": "", "sharePicture": "", "shareAlt": "", "searchTitle": "", "searchDescription": "", "keyPhrases": "", "pages": [{"id": "p-home", "title": "Home", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "sections": [{"id": "s-home-contents", "tabName": "Contents", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-home-story", "tabName": "Home", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-kk06ndy", "name": "Home Page", "paragraphs": [{"id": "r-3v542le", "columns": [{"id": "1", "rowId": "r-3v542le", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787696817044, "title": "", "text": "\"Creation eagerly awaits the revealing of <u>the sons of God</u>\"\n\n<a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Rom 8:19-21\">Rom 8:19-21</a>", "width": 1, "format": "Text Middle Large", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "format": {"columnText": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "20", "color": "#1b3a4b", "background": "", "borderColor": "", "borderWidth": "", "sides": {"t": true, "r": true, "b": true, "l": true}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowColor": "#ffffff", "padding": "", "marginTop": "", "marginBottom": "", "align": "center", "lineHeight": "1.2", "paraGap": "3"}}, "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Text Left"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "title": ""}, {"id": "r-7xst2ia", "columns": [{"id": "2", "rowId": "r-7xst2ia", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787731368162, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/sons-of-god-watching.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; border: 1px solid grey; width: 225px; max-width: 225px; height: 102px; max-height: 102px; object-fit: fill; object-position: center center;\" />", "width": 1, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "39", "rowId": "r-7xst2ia", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787731259746, "title": "", "text": "Have you ever wondered why this is our destiny in Christ?\nThe same phrase (<i>the sons of God)</i> appeared far earlier, when they watched God lay the earth’s foundations.\n\nSo why does creation need you — and for what critical role were you created to play?", "width": 1, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "format": {"columnText": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "18", "color": "#1b3a4b", "background": "", "borderColor": "", "borderWidth": "", "sides": {"t": true, "r": true, "b": true, "l": true}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowColor": "#00000040", "padding": "", "marginTop": "", "marginBottom": "", "align": "center", "lineHeight": "1.45", "paraGap": "18"}}, "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Text Middle Large"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0, "title": ""}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-home-intro", "tabName": "Introduction", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-sd2vs8k", "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true, "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatNames": {"website": "Default", "pageTitle": "Default"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "p-created", "title": "God wants to dwell with Family", "description": "The story of what is happening behind the scenes of Creation - from Genesis to Revelation.\n\nUnderstand passages there were a little strange instead of passing over them.  You will see and understand the bible like you never did before.\n\nAs you read this story, the Word of God will open up next to it with a single click or tap.", "sections": [{"id": "s-p2-contents", "tabName": "Contents", "description": "", "headings": [], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-story", "tabName": "Story", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-0uox0cu", "name": "God's Plan for Creation", "paragraphs": [{"id": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "20", "rowId": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787756202589, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/galaxy -01.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; width: 689px; max-width: 689px; height: 169px; max-height: 169px; object-fit: fill; object-position: center center;\" />", "width": 1, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default"}}, {"id": "r-usw9juf", "columns": [{"id": "3", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787777129676, "title": "", "text": "Before everything existed, Yahweh wanted to dwell with a human family in the garden of Eden. <span class=\"fn\"> </span> Love would be basis for every relationship in His presence.<span class=\"fn\">1</span>\n\nGod, whose name is Yahweh, planned to cover the whole earth with human beings.<span class=\"fn\">2</span> They would be adopted as His children and be sons of God. 3  Eden would end up as the Paradise of God - heaven and earth together, with the tree of Life.<span class=\"fn\">4 </span> That was, and still is, God's plan. 2", "width": 347.453125, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "4", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Isa 55:11\">Isa 55:11</a>", "width": 80.5625, "format": "Text Middle Large", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-8c2ynq6", "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "5", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "However, something is not mentioned in that account.  Before Yahweh created the earth, the <u>sons of God</u> were rejoicing; they were not human beings, they were heavenly beings.<span class=\"fn\">1</span> Heavenly beings dwell with God in heaven and minister here on earth. <span class=\"fn\">2</span>  \n\nGod's plan is to dwell with both His human and heavenly families in Paradise on earth, forever. <span class=\"fn\">3</span> \n\n<span class=\"fn\"></span>", "width": 352.015625, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "6", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Job 38:4-7\">Job 38:4-7</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Heb 1:14\">Heb 1:14</a>\n\n <span class=\"fn\">3</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"1Co 6:2-3\">1Co 6:2-3</a>", "width": 80, "format": "Bible References", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "85", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0, "name": "", "paragraphs": [{"id": "31", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "32", "rowId": "31", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787755659592, "title": "", "text": "Yahweh planted the garden of Eden and chose to start with one couple -- Adam and Eve, called Eden, where He walked with them. The tree of life was in the midst of the garden and everything was very good.", "width": 496, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "35", "rowId": "31", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787755559572, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:27\">Gen 1:27</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:28\">Gen 1:28</a>", "width": 107.8125, "format": "Bible References", "titleFormat": "Default"}]}, {"id": "r-jhfhiie", "columns": [{"id": "7", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787756202589, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/garden-of-eden-adam-eve-tree-of-life.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; width: 70px; max-width: 70px; height: 70px; max-height: 70px; object-fit: fill; object-position: center center;\" />", "width": 160, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "8", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787756103484, "title": "", "text": "Their descendants would fill the earth - every one of them created in His image. 1  Yahweh gives them the opportunity to reign as His ambassadors, tending and keeping His creation. 2", "width": 687, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "100", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 2, "editedAt": 1787755853260, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:27\">Gen 1:27</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span>  <a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Gen 1:28\">Gen 1:28</a>", "width": 1, "format": "Bible References", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}]}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-qa", "tabName": "Q&A", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-xa3eto1", "name": "Eden’s Symbolism", "paragraphs": [{"id": "r-fgx6ojv", "columns": [{"id": "9", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 119, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "10", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "Let US make MANKIND in our image", "text": "Does ‘mankind’ mean the whole human race? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 727, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-tscdkju", "columns": [{"id": "11", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 121, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "12", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787755522199, "title": "", "text": "Let US make MANKIND in our image Does ‘man’ mean Adam or mankind? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 725, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-b7wst1g", "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true, "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatNames": {"website": "Default", "pageTitle": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "108", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0, "title": "Adam and Eve Rebel - Eden", "description": "", "sections": [{"id": "109", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "tabName": "", "description": "", "headings": []}, {"id": "110", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0, "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true}]}, {"id": "111",